<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="sec serif">Four services. <i>One front door.</i></h2>
    <p class="lead2">Each service starts with a free or instant diagnostic, then a clear estimate, then licensed pros to do the work.</p>
    <div class="svcgrid">
      <a class="svccard" href="/permitting" data-tool="svc_permitting">
        <div class="ic">▣</div>
        <h3>Permitting &amp; Expediting</h3>
        <p>New, expired, and open permits handled end-to-end — records pull, package prep, filing, and revisions to a closed permit.</p>
        <ul><li>New, master, phase &amp; sub-permits</li><li>Expired / open permit resolution</li><li>All 67 Florida counties</li></ul>
        <span class="go">Explore permitting →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="svccard" href="/code-violations" data-tool="svc_code_violations">
        <div class="ic">⚠</div>
        <h3>Code Violation Removal</h3>
        <p>Clear open cases, liens, and unpermitted work. Start with a free property violation check, then a mapped path to a closed case.</p>
        <ul><li>Free, instant violation check</li><li>After-the-fact (ATF) permitting</li><li>Fine mitigation &amp; case closure</li></ul>
        <span class="go">Explore code violations →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="svccard" href="/drawings-engineering" data-tool="svc_drawings">
        <div class="ic">▤</div>
        <h3>Drawings &amp; Engineering</h3>
        <p>Code-compliant permit drawings and structural engineering, sealed by licensed partners and built to pass first review.</p>
        <ul><li>Sealed plans &amp; structural calcs</li><li>HVHZ, flood &amp; NOA approvals</li><li>Fewer rejection cycles</li></ul>
        <span class="go">Explore drawings →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="svccard" href="/inspections-signoff" data-tool="svc_inspections">
        <div class="ic">✓</div>
        <h3>Inspections &amp; Sign-Off</h3>
        <p>Private-provider inspection coordination from open permit to certificate of occupancy — so the project actually closes.</p>
        <ul><li>Private-provider inspections (F.S. 553.791)</li><li>Stage-by-stage scheduling</li><li>Final sign-off &amp; CO</li></ul>
        <span class="go">Explore inspections →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="toolnote">
      <div class="tx"><b>Start free with our tools.</b><p>Permit history check, feasibility reports, and submittal readiness — instant, online, no login.</p></div>
